<title>HONG KONG: China Treasure posts H1 net loss.</title>
<headline>China Treasure posts H1 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   15.0 loss  vs 0.1 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  77.33 loss vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    77.10 loss vs 0.42 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     169.53     vs 164.73</p>
<p>    Company name		 China Treasure Telecom Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - China Treasure Telecom is a cordless telephone designer and manufacturer.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on provision for slowing moving and obsolete stock, amortization and write-off of defferred development expenditure and provision for diminution in value for long-term investment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
